{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "复旦选课占用表",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "description": "新版 xk.fudan.edu.cn：无法上课时间表 + 邯郸/枫林连堂跨校提示。不自动选课。",
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": ["https://xk.fudan.edu.cn/course-selection/*"],
